      "effect": "Fusion Summon a monster that lists \"Blue-Fang Burst Dragon\" or \"Red-Boot Boost Dragon\" as material by shuffling monsters from your Graveyard into the Deck as material. Then, if you activated this card during your turn, your opponent can Special Summon 1 monster from their Graveyard to their field in face-up Attack Position.",
